WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.220
These ethical pillars are legally codified within
the European Union under Directive 2010-63EU.

2
00:00:06.901 --> 00:00:09.801
This directive establishes a foundational
legal postulate.

3
00:00:10.440 --> 00:00:16.021
It explicitly recognizes animal welfare as a core
European value and formally acknowledges the

4
00:00:16.021 --> 00:00:19.341
capacity of animals to feel and express
pain, suffering,

5
00:00:19.461 --> 00:00:20.320
and lasting harm.

6
00:00:20.320 --> 00:00:24.741
The legal protections extend across a wide
biological spectrum.

7
00:00:25.560 --> 00:00:28.220
They apply to all vertebrates, including
fetal forms,

8
00:00:28.701 --> 00:00:32.021
as well as specific, complex invertebrates
like cephalopods.

9
00:00:32.380 --> 00:00:37.141
The legislation enforces the three R's
principle, accepts that animals

10
00:00:37.141 --> 00:00:41.801
possess intrinsic value independent of
their utility, and strictly regulates

11
00:00:41.801 --> 00:00:43.681
any use of non-human primates.

12
00:00:44.421 --> 00:00:47.260
